<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telerj 7-mo net 83.7 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telerj 7-mo net 83.7 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's telecom firm Telerj sent the following statement to the stock exchanges on its results for the January to July period.</p>
<p>				Jan-July 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit		   83.781 million</p>
<p>    Net revenue		 728.332 million</p>
<p>    Net worth		     2.603 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
